  triage:verifiedInRound "qa-pr1280-r3" ;
  triage:resolutionNote "cipher added ai11_approved_herdr_socket_source(root, path) exemption to ai11_guarded_workspace_sources (boundary_enforcement.rs:2347-2351), scoping the D2 exemption specifically to crates/atm-herdr/src/transport_socket.rs and the fake_herdr_socket test-support tree, not a blanket carve-out. Verified empirically: cargo test -p atm-architecture --test boundary_enforcement ai11_deletion_gate_rejects_retired_windows_transport_ast_and_dependencies -> 1 passed at pin 26ea2806a (superseding trivial Cargo.lock-only commit over fb697d14d, no functional change)." .